45 780 Td
() Tj
T*
(   1. Text & Identity Types:) Tj
T*
(   - type="text": Standard single-line alphanumeric string entry.) Tj
T*
(   - type="password": Obfuscates entered characters for credential protection.) Tj
T*
(   - type="email": Validates against standard RFC email syntax and displays '@' on mobile) Tj
T*
(   keyboards.) Tj
T*
(   - type="tel": Numeric keyboard for phone numbers.) Tj
T*
(   - type="url": Validates complete URI schemes \(e.g., https://\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Numeric & Range Types:) Tj
T*
(   - type="number": Restricts input to numbers, supporting 'min', 'max', and 'step' attributes.) Tj
T*
(   - type="range": Renders a continuous horizontal slider control for adjusting numeric levels.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Temporal & Visual Types:) Tj
T*
(   - type="date", "time", "datetime-local": Activates native operating system calendar and clock) Tj
T*
(   pickers.) Tj
T*
(   - type="color": Renders a native color swatch picker returning a 6-digit hex code \(#RRGGBB\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Selection & File Types:) Tj
T*
(   - type="checkbox", "radio": Binary toggles and mutually exclusive option sets.) Tj
T*
(   - type="file": Triggers OS file selection dialogs, supporting 'multiple' and 'accept' MIME) Tj
T*
(   filters.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(>> Solution to Question 6:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
