(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Microdata is an HTML5 specification used to embed structured metadata directly within web) Tj
T*
(   content to enhance machine readability for search engines \(Google, Bing\) and power Rich) Tj
T*
(   Snippets:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Core Attributes:) Tj
T*
(   1. itemscope: Declares that the enclosing HTML block represents a discrete item object.) Tj
T*
(   2. itemtype: Specifies the vocabulary schema URL \(standardly defined by schema.org\) that) Tj
T*
(   defines the item type \(e.g., `itemtype="https://schema.org/Product"` or `Person`\).) Tj
T*
(   3. itemprop: Assigns specific properties to child elements \(e.g., `itemprop="name"`,) Tj
T*
(   `itemprop="price"`, `itemprop="ratingValue"`\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
