(   [Problem Statement]: Explain HTML5 Canvas rendering pipeline and write JavaScript code to draw a customized geometric composition \(rectangle, circle, text\).) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   The Canvas rendering pipeline requires selecting the canvas element, obtaining its 2D graphics) Tj
T*
(   rendering context, and invoking drawing primitives:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
